WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.834
Weeks went by.

2
00:00:07.835 --> 00:00:13.919
Henry often played with Rabbit.

3
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:20.879
Rabbit tried to be a good friend.

4
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:25.574
Then, in the fall, something changed.

5
00:00:25.575 --> 00:00:31.669
Henry left the house every day with a backpack.

6
00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:39.244
He was gone for hours and hours.

7
00:00:39.245 --> 00:00:42.802
One day Rabbit sat on the chair.

8
00:00:42.803 --> 00:00:46.294
Soldier stood near the open window.

9
00:00:46.295 --> 00:00:50.175
"What's happening outside?" Rabbit asked.

10
00:00:50.176 --> 00:00:53.917
"There are lots of leaves on the ground," Soldier said.

11
00:00:53.918 --> 00:00:57.080
"Soon the family will have to rake them."

12
00:00:57.081 --> 00:01:01.112
"Is Henry coming back yet?" Rabbit asked.

13
00:01:01.113 --> 00:01:06.476
"No, not yet," Soldier said.

14
00:01:06.477 --> 00:01:10.838
Rabbit waited a little longer.

15
00:01:10.839 --> 00:01:13.982
"How about now?"

16
00:01:13.983 --> 00:01:18.994
"Still no," Soldier said.

17
00:01:18.995 --> 00:01:23.270
"Stop asking, Rabbit!" Robot snapped.

18
00:01:23.271 --> 00:01:27.850
"Henry won't be back for hours."

19
00:01:27.851 --> 00:01:30.882
Suddenly Rabbit had an idea.

20
00:01:30.883 --> 00:01:34.723
"I'll try to move to the window," he thought.

21
00:01:34.724 --> 00:01:38.162
"Then I can watch for Henry myself!"

22
00:01:38.163 --> 00:01:42.450
Rabbit began trying to move.

23
00:01:42.451 --> 00:01:44.832
He twisted this way and that.

24
00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:49.725
He used all his strength.

25
00:01:49.726 --> 00:01:52.069
Robot was watching Rabbit.

26
00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:55.524
"What are you doing?" he asked.

27
00:01:55.525 --> 00:02:00.429
"I'm trying to move to the window," Rabbit said.

28
00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:05.067
"I want to watch for Henry myself."

29
00:02:05.068 --> 00:02:07.645
"Oh," Robot said.

30
00:02:07.646 --> 00:02:11.886
"Well . . . Good luck, I guess."

31
00:02:11.887 --> 00:02:17.268
"Thanks." Rabbit kept moving along slowly.

32
00:02:17.269 --> 00:02:19.968
He flopped onto the sill.

33
00:02:19.969 --> 00:02:22.169
Finally Rabbit stood up.

34
00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:26.058
But then he tripped.

35
00:02:26.059 --> 00:02:32.159
"Ahh!" Rabbit tumbled out the window!

